\f0\fs28 \cf0 Hope this helps some of you folks with laying out your Satisfactory Factory Builds!\
\
This library of icons is based in the popular diagram application Draw.io, available for Windows, Linux & Mac OSes. Be sure to download and use the latest version to ensure these work as effectively as possible.
\fs24 \
\
\
\
I have created this starter diagram file to include:\
\
1. Satisfactory Icons library\
2. Icons Library \'93Blueprint Blues\'94 variant\
3. A sample page of each type where the icons are all laid out so you can see their scales and relations to each other.\
\
This draw io file has page properties set to a grid of 8 (to approximate 8mx8m foundation blocks, and everything goes from there).\
